  "title": "Nani NDE 4907",
  "date": "1981 and 1987",
  "content": "After the doctors could not revive me, I found myself above them in the corner of the room. I felt so peaceful and did not want to return to wherever I had come from then. It was like a clear white lit area, I could not see myself, the flesh part, but I could feel everything else of being human. I did not see anyone though. It was so quiet. I really liked it. This feeling of peace I cannot really describe it all but it was the BEST feeling ever. Okay, after a few minutes of that (maybe five minutes) I went back down to see what these doctors were working on - I saw that it was me. I, then, for some reason, went back into my body and I felt so much pain as they brought me back to life. I felt this twice in my life. For some reason I am still here. I am NOT afraid of death now. I welcome it - I am excited to pass on; whenever that may be.",
